{"run_id": "20260830T125957-hepkg-269532", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "780b816fd36c", "git_sha": "6840022-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 4 analyses that estimate a background using an ABCD method or a related technique:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Uses a \"Modified ABCD estimate\" (this might be a mis-tag).\n- **2011.07812**: Uses the \"ABCD data-driven background estimation method\".\n- **2012.01581**: Uses a \"Data-driven ABCD-style ratio method using eight non-overlapping regions (A-H) defined by three near-uncorrelated selection criteria\" (this method uses eight regions, not independent regions).\n- **2511.11853**: Uses the \"ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\".\n\nOf these, 2 papers match the question as asked, and 1 paper uses a similar method but with a different approach (using eight regions instead of independent regions). One paper (2004.01678) might be mis-tagged.\n\nThese differences highlight the variations in how these techniques are applied across different analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "facets", "args": {"field": "background_methods", "values": ["ABCD", "ABCDStyleSideband", "MatrixMethod"], "mode": "any", "category": "search"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 1.645}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2511.11853", "a-h", "abcd", "abcd-style", "background", "control", "criteria", "data", "data-driven", "defined", "eight", "estimate", "estimation", "fits", "matrix", "method", "modified", "near-uncorrelated", "non-overlapping", "parametric", "ratio", "regions", "search", "selection", "three", "using", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9517, "completion_tokens": 284, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 13.15125010162592, "reviews": [{"search_text": "background_methods=['ABCD', 'ABCDStyleSideband', 'MatrixMethod']", "tally": {"exact": 2, "broader": 1, "unrelated": 1}, "kept": 3, "candidates": 4, "defaulted": 0, "calls": 1, "errors": 0, "tail_keep_rate": 0.75, "dropped": [{"id": "2004.01678", "why": "Modified ABCD estimate"}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 13.15125010162592, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9801.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.75, "judged_recall": 0.3333333333333333, "judged_f1": 0.46153846153846156, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.23333333333333334, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 0.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0, "productive": 1.0, "redundant": 0.0, "breadth": 1.0, "stopped_early": 1.0}}
