{"run_id": "20260830T125957-hepkg-269532", "qid": "gen-retrieval-535f7ab1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "780b816fd36c", "git_sha": "6840022-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample W+jets background MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following 12 analyses used the W+jets background MC sample:\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2010.14293: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb -1 of $\\\\sqrt{s}$ =13 TeV $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2107.12553: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2112.00895: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=8\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2112.03161: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2209.07327: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2307.01094: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2508.13", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "W+jets", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 13.544}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:faf187c3052688d9764c6e95", "hepkg:result:46ee77edd095181b02474a60", "hepkg:result:65e536ea4e5f3196d16e8bfc", "hepkg:result:d6abc95cf998b1c903742a29"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "secon